      "@id": "kt:apple-iphone-launch",
      "@type": "kto:Case",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Apple iPhone Launch",
      "skos:definition": "Apple's 2007–2008 entry into mobile phones: the iPhone was unveiled at Macworld in January 2007, shipped in the U.S. in June 2007 through an exclusive Cingular/AT&T deal, was repriced within ten weeks, and was turned into a third-party software platform with the iPhone 3G and App Store in July 2008, a case in category redefinition, carrier bargaining power and platform strategy.",
