      "skos:prefLabel": "Toyota Production System (TPS): Waste Elimination Through Just-in-Time Flow and Built-in Quality",
      "skos:definition": "Toyota's management and production system, resting on the twin pillars of just-in-time and jidoka and sustained by standardized work and kaizen, that seeks the highest quality, lowest cost and shortest lead time by systematically removing waste; it is the model from which \"lean production\" was abstracted.",
